---
const W = 900, H = 192;
const X0 = 170; // bar origin
const SCALE = 650 / 122; // 122 ms drawn as 650 px
const seg = (ms: number) => (ms * SCALE).toFixed(1);
const dns = [X0, X0 + 40 * SCALE];
const tcp = [dns[1], dns[1] + 40 * SCALE];
const tls = [tcp[1], tcp[1] + 40 * SCALE];
const app = [tls[1], tls[1] + 2 * SCALE];
const app2 = [X0, X0 + 2 * SCALE];
const ghostEnd = X0 + 650;
---
<figure class="bep1d">
  <div class="bep1d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Illustrative budget on a 40 ms RTT link: the first request pays DNS 40 ms, TCP 40 ms, TLS 40 ms and the app 2 ms, about 122 ms in total; the second request on the same connection pays only the app's 2 ms.">
    <text x="20" y="52" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>first request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request đầu</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="70" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>fresh connection</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>connection mới</tspan></text>
    <rect x={dns[0]} y="36" width={dns[1] - dns[0]} height="42" class="seg" />
    <rect x={tcp[0]} y="36" width={tcp[1] - tcp[0]} height="42" class="seg" />
    <rect x={tls[0]} y="36" width={tls[1] - tls[0]} height="42" class="seg" />
    <rect x={app[0]} y="36" width={app[1] - app[0]} height="42" class="segr" />
    <text x={(dns[0] + dns[1]) / 2} y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="l">DNS · 40 ms</text>
    <text x={(tcp[0] + tcp[1]) / 2} y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="l">TCP · 40 ms</text>
    <text x={(tls[0] + tls[1]) / 2} y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="l">TLS · 40 ms</text>
    <text x={(app[0] + app[1]) / 2} y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="l">app · 2 ms</text>
    <text x="832" y="62" class="tt">≈ 122 ms</text>
    <path d={`M ${dns[0]} 92 L ${dns[0]} 86 L ${tls[1]} 86 L ${tls[1]} 92`} class="br" />
    <text x={(dns[0] + tls[1]) / 2} y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>three handshakes, one RTT each, on a 40 ms link</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ba handshake, mỗi cái một RTT, trên đường RTT 40 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="152" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>second request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request hai</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="170" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>same connection</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tái dùng connection</tspan></text>
    <rect x={app2[0]} y="136" width={app2[1] - app2[0]} height="42" class="segr" />
    <rect x={app2[1]} y="136" width={ghostEnd - app2[1]} height="42" class="ghost" />
    <text x={(app2[1] + ghostEnd) / 2} y="162" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>handshakes already paid — skipped</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>handshake đã trả rồi — bỏ qua</tspan></text>
    <text x="832" y="162" class="tt">≈ 2 ms</text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>An illustrative budget on a 40 ms RTT link: the first request pays three handshakes before your 2 ms endpoint; the second request on the same connection skips them all.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ngân sách minh hoạ trên đường RTT 40 ms: request đầu trả ba handshake trước khi tới endpoint 2 ms của bạn; request hai trên cùng connection bỏ qua hết.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep1d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep1d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep1d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep1d text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep1d .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep1d .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep1d .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep1d .l { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep1d .seg { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep1d .segr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep1d .ghost { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep1d .br { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .bep1d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
